<h2>Walks in parks and forest trails</h2>
<p>Walking dates are free or very cheap, and they suit people who feel nervous face to face. Nairobi has green spaces you can enjoy in the daytime, and Karura Forest is one of the best known, with marked trails, bike paths and picnic areas. Other public parks and nature areas around the city and county can work too.</p>
<p>Because you will be outdoors, a few precautions help:</p>
<ul>
<li>Go in the morning or early afternoon, when more people are around.</li>
